<%- include('../partials/head', { title }) %>
<body class="home-page">
  <header class="home-header">
    <div class="home-container flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-sm font-bold text-white">PB</span>
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white sm:text-lg">匹克球比賽平台</span>
      </a>
      <%- include('../partials/public-nav') %>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="home-section sm:py-20">
      <div class="home-container">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">線上報名 · 賽程管理 · 即時比分</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">一站式匹克球賽事平台</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
          協助不同比賽記錄賽事、分配賽程，以及保存參賽者的參賽記錄。大會可集中管理報名與賽程，參賽者亦可隨時查閱自己的報名與賽事資訊。
        </p>

        <% if (typeof session !== 'undefined' && session.memberId) { %>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/member" class="home-btn">查看我的報名</a>
            <a href="#events" class="home-btn--ghost">瀏覽賽事</a>
          </div>
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/member/register" class="home-btn">立即註冊會員</a>
            <a href="/member/login" class="home-btn--ghost">已有帳號？登入</a>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">報名前請先註冊；雙打搭檔亦須各自建立帳號。</p>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="events" class="home-section--alt scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="home-container">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-2xl">比賽列表</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">選擇賽事查看賽程、比分，或進行線上報名</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/events" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 underline">全部比賽 →</a>
        </div>

        <%- include('../partials/event-list', {
          events,
          categoryTitle: '匹克球',
          emptyMessage: '暫無開放中的賽事，請稍後再來。',
        }) %>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section">
      <div class="home-container">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-2xl">平台主要用途</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 sm:text-base">為賽事主辦方與參賽者提供清晰分工的數位工具</p>

        <div class="home-feature-grid">
          <article class="home-card">
            <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">📋</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-emerald-300">記錄賽事</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
              集中管理多場比賽的資料：組別、隊伍、場次與即時比分，讓不同賽事各有獨立頁面，觀眾與參賽者均可查閱。
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="home-card">
            <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">🗓️</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-sky-300">分配賽程</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
              小組賽、淘汰賽、場地與時間一覽無遺；賽務可於後台編排對戰表，前台自動更新積分與晉級對位。
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="home-card">
            <div class="home-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">👤</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-amber-300">參賽記錄</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
              參賽者以會員帳號線上報名、付款，並於會員中心查閱自己的報名狀態與歷史參賽紀錄。
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section--alt">
      <div class="home-container">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-2xl">線上報名流程</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">三步完成報名，再於賽事日查閱賽程與比分</p>
          </div>
          <% if (!(typeof session !== 'undefined' && session.memberId)) { %>
            <a href="/member/register" class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400 underline hover:text-emerald-300">前往註冊 →</a>
          <% } %>
        </div>

        <ol class="home-steps">
          <li class="home-card flex gap-4">
            <span class="home-step-num bg-emerald-600">1</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-white">註冊／登入會員</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">填寫基本資料與 DUPR；雙打請確保搭檔亦已註冊。</p>
              <% if (!(typeof session !== 'undefined' && session.memberId)) { %>
                <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  <a href="/member/register" class="home-btn--sm">註冊</a>
                  <a href="/member/login" class="home-btn--sm-ghost">登入</a>
                </p>
              <% } else { %>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-emerald-400">✓ 已登入</p>
              <% } %>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="home-card flex gap-4">
            <span class="home-step-num bg-sky-700">2</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-white">選擇賽事與組別</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">於下方賽事列表進入報名頁，選擇合適組別並填寫隊伍資料。</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="home-card flex gap-4">
            <span class="home-step-num bg-amber-700">3</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-white">完成付款</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">線上付款確認後，可於會員中心查看報名狀態；賽程開放後亦可查閱對戰與比分。</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-slate-800 px-4 py-8 sm:px-6">
    <div class="home-container flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm text-slate-500 sm:flex-row">
      <p>© 匹克球比賽平台</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <% if (!(typeof session !== 'undefined' && session.memberId)) { %>
          <a href="/member/register" class="hover:text-slate-300">會員註冊</a>
          <a href="/member/login" class="hover:text-slate-300">會員登入</a>
        <% } %>
        <a href="/admin/login" class="hover:text-slate-300">管理後台</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
